#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before you create, find out whose the bean is, and claim it — or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The one place a claim is drawn (bean m8gz, owner 2026-10-24); the gateway after this reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:226
#. Diagram label
msgid "Provision gh-pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:101
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Provisions the gh-pages branch before Pages is switched on (Task_ProvisionGhPages, #2417), derives the URL, and holds the report that follows it: \"unprovisioned\" routes back to provisioning, and \"live\", \"not-yet\" and \"unknown\" are reached by exclusive branches of one DMN-computed gateway, and this lane is what keeps a failed probe from being reported as the softer \"not-yet\" it would be tempting to default to."
msgstr ""

