#. Diagram label
msgid "Start the Pages build and derive the URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:217
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The first beans: what the author said they want to get started on, one bean per top-level content object they named."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:200
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The misspeak case. The user has a folio and wants a document in it; this process ends and authoring-a-document.bpmn or authoring-a-paper.bpmn begins. Ending here rather than scaffolding is the whole value of the triage."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:156
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The question is presented as a short list of selectable options, never as free prose, and the list names the top-level content types the agent knows about. The answer becomes the statedIntent fact and the table is evaluated again — the user's answer is read as evidence, like any other fact."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/conduct/getting-started.bpmn:178
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Three questions the scan cannot answer: import these or not; library or content for each group; leave the files where they are or reorganize to declutter. Plus whether to dispatch one ingestion agent or a small swarm. Non-relaxable: nobody's files are moved or imported on inference."
msgstr ""

